      "filename": "Granite Mountains, Mojave National Preserve, California (15470235018).jpg",
      "title": "File:Granite Mountains, Mojave National Preserve, California (15470235018).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Granite_Mountains%2C_Mojave_National_Preserve%2C_California_%2815470235018%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Granite_Mountains,_Mojave_National_Preserve,_California_(15470235018).jpg",
      "width": 4000,
      "height": 2976,
